// Records node:crypto behaviour for the cases of a controls file. Usage (Node 24.18.1):
//   docker run --rm -i -v "$PWD":/w node:24.18.1-alpine node /w/recorder.js < controls.json > recorded.json
// Reads { cases: [{ id, fn, args, isolate? }] } and writes the same document with a `result` per case.
